    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d284-a2">

                <pb facs="0408" n="328" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg328"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Squiers to Señor de Zaldo</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-07-07"><hi rendition="#italic">July 7,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Your Excellency</hi>: In acknowledging receipt of
                    your excellency’s note of the 4th instant communicating the resolution of the
                    house of representatives adjourning the session on that day in honor of the
                    anniversary of our national Independence, I beg to request that you will convey
                    to the proper quarter my personal thanks and appreciation of the honor and
                    courtesy shown my country, with the assurances of <pb facs="0409" n="329"
                        xml:id="pg329"/> the pleasure that it will afford me to advise my Government
                    of this special act and evidence of friendship and good feeling entertained for
                    the United States by the representatives in congress of the Cuban people.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">H. G. Squiers.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
